    "detailed_description": "This is a relaxing  &quot;Muyu&quot; knocking simulation game. You just need to knock the &quot;Muyu&quot;, time will pass, experience the day and light, experience the four seasons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is a simple click game, when you click, time will pass a little (with the change of seasons, day, night and random weather).<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also let it knock automatically, so you can free your hands and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nToo stressed? Confused? Tired? Anxious?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust tap the screen to make some regular sounds, enjoy the neglected daily nature, and you will find peace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nParticularly suitable for relieving anxiety and insomnia symptoms.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a relaxing  &quot;Muyu&quot; knocking simulation game. You just need to knock the &quot;Muyu&quot;, time will pass, experience the day and light, experience the four seasons.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is a simple click game, when you click, time will pass a little (with the change of seasons, day, night and random weather).<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also let it knock automatically, so you can free your hands and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nToo stressed? Confused? Tired? Anxious?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust tap the screen to make some regular sounds, enjoy the neglected daily nature, and you will find peace.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nParticularly suitable for relieving anxiety and insomnia symptoms.",
    "short_description": "Peace comes from nature and regularity Tap the screen to knock the &quot;Muyu&quot; and advance the time while enjoying the neglected daily nature, and you will find peace. Suitable for relieving anxiety and insomnia symptoms.",
